      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not an issue that can be fixed by VRChat\n\nThese shaders read from something called the \"Camera Depth Texture\" to figure out where they should draw the fog\n\nFor something to be put in the Camera Depth Texture the shader it uses needs to have a \"ShadowCaster\" pass\n\nNone of the quest-compatible shaders have a ShadowCaster pass which is why the fog in these worlds appears above them.\n\nthe fog does not know that there is something there",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
