  "details": "Noticed back in May that Fallback avatars got overdrawn with worlds using some form of fog.\nImLeXz's Midnight Rooftop has a fog effect (on PC at least) using Silent's SkyProbeFog Shader, causing overdraw on all avatars using VRC Mobile shaders.\nI don't know enough about shaders to point at exactly what is causing it. Dx",
